OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMist and fog
OL,6,Fpatches will reform tonight for
OL,7,FEngland and parts of Wales, becoming
OL,8,Fdense in places. Cloudier in the north
OL,9,Fwith outbreaks of light rain sinking
OL,10,Finto northern England and Wales.
OL,11,FClearer skies following with a touch
OL,12,Fof frost.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FA foggy start for England and
OL,15,FWales, slowly clearing during late
OL,16,Fmorning for most. Cloudier for
OL,17,Fnorthern England and Wales with rain
OL,18,Fpushing southwards. Sunnier for
OL,19,FScotland and Northern Ireland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
